    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a post-apocalyptic world teeming with mysterious creatures, Chronomon combines monster taming and farm sims for a single, seamless experience. Catch them, train them, evolve them - then take the fight to the Epoch Syndicate, while uniting towns through trade, non-linear quests, and, of course, defeating the villains that threaten everyone. Don't forget to take care of yourself: Hearty meals and plenty of sleep matter as much as chronomon in the vibrant, ever-changing world that's yours to explore! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to share the experience? Play anywhere thanks to <strong>cross-save support</strong> <strong>for all devices</strong> (Mobile Android/IOS) and take your game on the go! Consoles and Smartwatch ports coming soon.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame over 100 Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ee6d5cf7bfaca9258533dfcf84e5804c.poster.avif?t=1754575707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ee6d5cf7bfaca9258533dfcf84e5804c.webm?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ee6d5cf7bfaca9258533dfcf84e5804c.mp4?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Catch over 100 monsters (in both regular and rare varieties with unique traits), who will fight for you, explore for you, work the farm for you - and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Train each monster to tweak and tailor them to fit your playstyle, thanks to a robust RPG system: 39 skill trees and over 300 distinct skills, upgraded further by scoring Perfect Hits in combat, monster Imprints, and special passives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Solve puzzles with the chronomon, using their unique abilities to overcome challenges scattered across the map and unlock special treasures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Put them to work on the farm, rebuilding it from scratch and gaining special rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farm after the Apocalypse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/1169b8ca126a49f67d8e78b734d7250c.poster.avif?t=1754575707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/1169b8ca126a49f67d8e78b734d7250c.webm?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/1169b8ca126a49f67d8e78b734d7250c.mp4?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plant and cultivate over 50 distinct types of crops, then turn them into a variety of meals to keep yourself alive and your chronomon in fighting shape. Then trade the surplus with nearby towns for essential goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Head out into the world to gather raw materials for the farm and take a break while fishing, with a chance to catch over 20 types of fish (and then cook or sell them).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your chronomon to maximize production on the farm, using their unique abilities to turn it into the agricultural heart of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize and decorate the farm to your liking, making it a spot of joy and hope in an apocalyptic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/70c99a62bf7bc2a562914a0992eb112a.poster.avif?t=1754575707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/70c99a62bf7bc2a562914a0992eb112a.webm?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/70c99a62bf7bc2a562914a0992eb112a.mp4?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Head into town to undertake quests to rebuild them and forge lasting friendships. Each playthrough is unique, thanks to branching storylines and choices that matter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adventure across a dynamic world, changing with the time of day. Head out at dawn for casual, mostly safe exploration - or strike out at dusk on risky expeditions with high rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a dynamic weather system, with drizzling rains, freezing blizzards, and other natural disasters that directly affect chronomon battles and your farming efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free the world from the oppressive Epoch Syndicate, seeking to conquer the survivors of the apocalypse for its own, nefarious ends! Players can choose to progress the story as a Farmer or Monster Tamer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ae571fbe3910d773bc3309d4187264bf.poster.avif?t=1754575707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ae571fbe3910d773bc3309d4187264bf.webm?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ae571fbe3910d773bc3309d4187264bf.mp4?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a post-apocalyptic world teeming with mysterious creatures, Chronomon combines monster taming and farm sims for a single, seamless experience. Catch them, train them, evolve them - then take the fight to the Epoch Syndicate, while uniting towns through trade, non-linear quests, and, of course, defeating the villains that threaten everyone. Don't forget to take care of yourself: Hearty meals and plenty of sleep matter as much as chronomon in the vibrant, ever-changing world that's yours to explore! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to share the experience? Play anywhere thanks to <strong>cross-save support</strong> <strong>for all devices</strong> (Mobile Android/IOS) and take your game on the go! Consoles and Smartwatch ports coming soon.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame over 100 Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ee6d5cf7bfaca9258533dfcf84e5804c.poster.avif?t=1754575707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ee6d5cf7bfaca9258533dfcf84e5804c.webm?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ee6d5cf7bfaca9258533dfcf84e5804c.mp4?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Catch over 100 monsters (in both regular and rare varieties with unique traits), who will fight for you, explore for you, work the farm for you - and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Train each monster to tweak and tailor them to fit your playstyle, thanks to a robust RPG system: 39 skill trees and over 300 distinct skills, upgraded further by scoring Perfect Hits in combat, monster Imprints, and special passives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Solve puzzles with the chronomon, using their unique abilities to overcome challenges scattered across the map and unlock special treasures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Put them to work on the farm, rebuilding it from scratch and gaining special rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farm after the Apocalypse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/1169b8ca126a49f67d8e78b734d7250c.poster.avif?t=1754575707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/1169b8ca126a49f67d8e78b734d7250c.webm?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/1169b8ca126a49f67d8e78b734d7250c.mp4?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plant and cultivate over 50 distinct types of crops, then turn them into a variety of meals to keep yourself alive and your chronomon in fighting shape. Then trade the surplus with nearby towns for essential goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Head out into the world to gather raw materials for the farm and take a break while fishing, with a chance to catch over 20 types of fish (and then cook or sell them).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your chronomon to maximize production on the farm, using their unique abilities to turn it into the agricultural heart of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize and decorate the farm to your liking, making it a spot of joy and hope in an apocalyptic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/70c99a62bf7bc2a562914a0992eb112a.poster.avif?t=1754575707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/70c99a62bf7bc2a562914a0992eb112a.webm?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/70c99a62bf7bc2a562914a0992eb112a.mp4?t=1754575707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Head into town to undertake quests to rebuild them and forge lasting friendships. Each playthrough is unique, thanks to branching storylines and choices that matter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adventure across a dynamic world, changing with the time of day. Head out at dawn for casual, mostly safe exploration - or strike out at dusk on risky expeditions with high rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a dynamic weather system, with drizzling rains, freezing blizzards, and other natural disasters that directly affect chronomon battles and your farming efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free the world from the oppressive Epoch Syndicate, seeking to conquer the survivors of the apocalypse for its own, nefarious ends! Players can choose to progress the story as a Farmer or Monster Tamer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ae571fbe3910d773bc3309d4187264bf.poster.avif?t=1754575707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370420/extras/ae571fbe3910d773bc3309d4187264bf.webm?t=175457570